      "direction": "down",
      "gap": "lg"
     },
     "content": "\\frac{v_2}{v_1} = \\frac{k[\\ce{NH3}]_2^2}{k[\\ce{NH3}]_1^2} = \\left(\\frac{[\\ce{NH3}]_2}{[\\ce{NH3}]_1}\\right)^2",
